使用须知 / Notice

蓝盾 BlueGuard 是主机安全巡检工具，用于检测和处置**自己拥有或已获授权**的
Windows 主机的安全状态。禁止将其用于未获授权的机器。

BlueGuard is a host security inspection tool intended for Windows machines you
own or are explicitly authorized to assess. Do not use it against machines you
do not control.
